[0.002, "o", "=== http_logviewer: Idiomatic Nim & Architectural Integrity (Phase 08 / Category A) ===\r\n\r\n[1] Pure Side-Effect-Free Functions (func vs proc):\r\n  Routines performing mathematical, parsing, or formatting transformations are declared with 'func'.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  formatStatusCode(404) -> '404'\r\n  isoToFlagEmoji('DE')   -> 🇩🇪 Germany\r\n  normalizeUrl(...)      -> /products/{id}?session=abc\r\n  analyzeAttackPayload   -> flags: {SensitiveFileProbe}, rules: @[\"Sensitive:/.env\"]\r\n\r\n[2] Immutability First & Value Objects:\r\n  Domain records (HttpLogEntry, ThreatProfile, GeoLocation) use immutable let bindings by default.\r\n"]
